        "originalHeight": 689
      }
    },
    {
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "originalText": "不久，吉努举起了她的画。“哇，好多圆形、三角形和正方形！“奶奶说道。",
      "text": "不久，吉努举起了她的画。“哇，好多圆形、三角形和正方形！”奶奶说道。",
      "image": {
        "url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/static.storyweaver.org.in/illustration_crops/61951/size7/c70545dbe6c0695820e27657efa33705.jpg",
        "sha256": "6e19ae1bca167d39f32e0852730636d4d092ac5ed6e06919dfb4f609987bbb8a",
